@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
 ## API
 
-`readSettings(path)` returns the settings text synchronously.
+`readSettings(path)` now returns `Promise<string>` instead of `string`.
+Callers must await the result. Synchronous reads are no longer supported.
+This avoids blocking the event loop during file reads.
